Is this the same notation? Sorry. Is this the same? What? Is this the same notation? No, no, no, no, no. I said that last time. Okay. Sorry. I said that last time. I'm using the notation where in D_{2n}, this is the order of the group.

49
00:10:03,079 --> 00:10:15,560
让我澄清一下：它作用在正 n 边形上，也就是 Artin 称作 D_n 的群。好，而那个旋转群他会称作 C_n。
And let me clarify that: so that acts on the n-gon, and it's what Artin calls D_n. Okay, just whereas this one he would call C_n.

50
00:10:15,560 --> 00:10:17,560
Artin 确实把那个叫作 D_n 吗？
Artin does call that D_n?

51
00:10:17,560 --> 00:10:20,120
是的，他把这个群称作 D_n。
Yeah, he calls this group D_n.

52
00:10:20,120 --> 00:10:26,520
所以对 Artin 来说，克莱因四元群是 D_2，而三个字母上的对称群是 D_3。
So the Klein four-group for Artin would be D_2, and the symmetric group on three letters would be D_3.

53
00:10:26,520 --> 00:10:38,883
顺便说一句，这个二面体群与三个字母上的对称群之间的同构，就是这个二面体群在这三个顶点上的置换，或者等价地说在三条边上的置换。
By the way, the permutation that the the isomorphism between this and the symmetric group on three letters is the permutation of this dihedral group on these three vertices, or equivalently on the three edges.

54
00:10:38,883 --> 00:10:48,920
一般而言，如果你仔细想想，我所记的 D_{2n} 是2n 个字母上的对称群的一个子群。
And in general, if you think about it, this D_{2n} as I have it is a subgroup of the symmetric group on 2n letters.

55
00:10:48,920 --> 00:10:56,280
实际上是对称群 S_n 的子群，抱歉，因为它置换正 n 边形的顶点。
In fact, a symmetric group on n letters, sorry, because it permutes the vertices of a regular n-gon.

56
00:10:56,280 --> 00:11:05,160
但区别在于，当 n 大于 3 时，这个群的阶是 2n，而那个群的阶是 n!，是一个大得多的群。
But the difference is that when you get n bigger than 3, this group has order 2n, this group has order n!, and is a much bigger group.

57
00:11:05,160 --> 00:11:11,000
但恰好在 n = 3 的情形下，它们正好相同。
But just in the case when n = 3, they turn out to be the same.

58
